WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.700
Everyone has good and bad things happen in their life.

00:00:03.700 --> 00:00:08.140
These events can affect us a lot and even change how our body and brain work.

00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:11.800
What's really interesting is that people react in different ways.

00:00:11.800 --> 00:00:14.900
For one person, getting an A on a test and hearing a teacher say,

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:18.500
I believe in you can help them try harder and enjoy school more.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.500
For someone else, it might not make a big difference.

